# The image is built from this repository's source, so the context is the working tree
# minus what the build must not see: dependencies and output it produces itself, artifacts
# a developer's machine leaves lying around, and the local-only files a working copy
# carries. Every entry here is also one fewer thing that can differ between two builds of
# the same commit and needlessly invalidate the COPY layer.

# History, and the workflows that drive the build from outside it. The absence of .git is
# also why the artifact carries no git stamp of its own: the commit reaches it through the
# PENGUIN_COMMIT build arg instead.
.git
.gitattributes
.github

# Installed and generated by the build itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/server/web-dist
packages/desktop/out
packages/desktop/stage
.turbo

# Artifacts of running things locally.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
packages/landing/.blog-assets
**/*.log

# Local configuration, and the symlinks a development checkout carries to reach the design
# repository — absent from a CI checkout, and dangling anywhere else.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
design
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Editor and OS leftovers.
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
**/*.swp
